      139.65,
      339.13,
      448.08,
      350.2
    ],
    "text": "FISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCES ACT, No. 02 OF 1996",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      363.13,
      539.96,
      386.2
    ],
    "text": "Regulations made by the Minister of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Development under Section 61 of the Fisheriesand Aquatic Resources Act, No. 2 of 1996 read with Section 28 of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      399.13,
      539.84,
      446.2
    ],
    "text": "MAHINDA AMARAWEERA,Minister of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Development.Colombo,27th February 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      266.85,
      459.13,
      320.85,
      470.2
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      483.13,
      539.84,
      506.2
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as Prohibition of Use of Spears in Fishing Operations RegulationsNo. 1 of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      519.13,
      448.07,
      530.2
    ],
    "text": "2. No person shall use or possess, or have on board any local fishing boat, any spear gun.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      543.13,
      510.44,
      566.2
    ],
    "text": "3. No person shall engage in any fishing operation using spear guns or hand held spears within Sri LankaWaters.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      579.13,
      184.06,
      590.2
    ],
    "text": "4. In these Regulations -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      95.85,
      603.13,
      403.54,
      614.2
    ],
    "text": "\u201cSpear gun\u201d means a gun used to catch fish by shooting with pointed spike ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      627.13,
      539.92,
      650.2
    ],
    "text": "\u201cSri Lanka Waters\u201d shall have the same meaning as in the Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Act, No. 2 of1996.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
